  unitName: Demon Pike Drevas
  unitId: 30694
  unitNumber: 1182
  description: A demon born in Grand Gaia. An orphan since birth, the only thing
    to influence Drevas were the feelings of despair and demonic force emanating
    from the demon crystals which had been imported to his homeland from Ishgria.
    Unfamiliar with how to dispel his own loneliness, Drevas lay waste to ancient
    Grand Gaia as his powers grew. His most remarkable ability, however, was the
    power to turn others into demons. Legend has it that the gods had to devise a
    plan to limit Drevas's reach because of this.
  summonDesc: You better not.<br>This has nothing to do with me...
  fusionDesc: That's unnecessary.<br>I don't need your kindness...
